00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:58.800
We agree on that.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:01:59.639
No, I care about the Constitution-

00:01:59.639 --> 00:02:00.480
You agree with the Constitution.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.120
